 "What special rule applies to an alternative re-planned at the original site?",
 ["File a statement with the industry authority, which forwards it to the original reviewing authority, free of the allocation rules","File a draft report directly with the central authority, which re-determines jurisdiction under Table 1","File a difference analysis report with the original reviewing authority, which reports it centrally for record","File a change comparison table with the industry authority for record, while jurisdiction still follows the allocation in Article 12(1)"],
